            <trans-unit id="plugin.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Pristabell</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plugin.table.description" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards, comparison table or compact rows from one pricing table record.</source><target>Plankort, jämförelsetabell eller kompakta rader från en pristabellpost.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.general" approved="yes"><source>General</source><target>Allmänt</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planer</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Funktioner</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Priser</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="tab.highlight" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Framhäv</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Titel</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description" approved="yes"><source>Introductory note</source><target>Inledande text</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.description.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown above the prices in every layout, e.g. “All prices per month, plus VAT.”</source><target>Visas ovanför priserna i alla layouter, t.ex. ”Alla priser per månad, plus moms.”</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode" approved="yes"><source>Entered amounts are</source><target>Angivna belopp är</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.hint" approved="yes"><source>Defines how the entered amounts are read. Conversion only runs from net to gross, never the other way round.</source><target>Definierar hur de angivna beloppen tolkas. Omvandling sker endast från netto till brutto, aldrig tvärtom.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.net" approved="yes"><source>Net prices</source><target>Nettopriser</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxMode.gross" approved="yes"><source>Gross prices</source><target>Bruttopriser</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate" approved="yes"><source>Tax rate in percent</source><target>Momssats i procent</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxRate.hint" approved="yes"><source>Basis for the gross display. 0 skips the conversion.</source><target>Underlag för bruttoprisvisning. 0 hoppar över omvandlingen.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Visitors may switch between net and gross</source><target>Besökare kan växla mellan netto och brutto</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.taxSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the page only shows the option selected above.</source><target>Om alternativet inte är markerat visas endast det alternativ som valts ovan.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Currency switchable</source><target>Valutaväxling</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencySwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one currency is entered for the plans.</source><target>Växlingen visas endast om fler än en valuta har angetts för planerna.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable" approved="yes"><source>Billing period switchable</source><target>Faktureringsperiodväxling</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.periodSwitchable.hint" approved="yes"><source>The switch only appears if more than one period is entered for the plans.</source><target>Växlingen visas endast om fler än en period har angetts för planerna.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition" approved="yes"><source>Currency symbol</source><target>Valutasymbol</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.hint" approved="yes"><source>English usually puts it before the amount (“€ 99”), German and most continental European languages after it (“99 €”).</source><target>Engelska placerar den vanligtvis före beloppet (”€ 99”), tyska och de flesta kontinentaleuropeiska språk efter det (”99 €”).</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.before" approved="yes"><source>before the amount (€ 99)</source><target>före beloppet (€ 99)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.currencyPosition.after" approved="yes"><source>after the amount (99 €)</source><target>efter beloppet (99 €)</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Button label</source><target>Knappetikett</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to all plans without a label of their own. Empty means “Select”.</source><target>Gäller alla planer utan egen etikett. Tomt betyder ”Välj”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.selectLabel.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Select</source><target>Välj</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.plans" approved="yes"><source>Plans</source><target>Planer</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups" approved="yes"><source>Feature groups</source><target>Funktionsgrupper</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="table.groups.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features belong to the table, not to a single plan — that is the only way the comparison table compares like with like.</source><target>Funktioner tillhör tabellen, inte en enskild plan — det är det enda sättet för jämförelsetabellen att jämföra lika med lika.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.title" approved="yes"><source>Name</source><target>Namn</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle" approved="yes"><source>Subtitle</source><target>Underrubrik</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.subtitle.hint" approved="yes"><source>One line below the name, e.g. “6 job ads for 30 days each”.</source><target>En rad under namnet, t.ex. ”6 jobbannonser i 30 dagar vardera”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow" approved="yes"><source>Eyebrow</source><target>Överrubrik</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.eyebrow.hint" approved="yes"><source>Small line above the name, e.g. “48 resources included”.</source><target>Liten rad ovanför namnet, t.ex. ”48 resurser ingår”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.description" approved="yes"><source>Description</source><target>Beskrivning</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite" approved="yes"><source>Highlight</source><target>Framhäv</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.favourite.hint" approved="yes"><source>The plan gets a border and shadow in the accent colour, and a tinted column in the comparison table.</source><target>Planen får en ram och skugga i accentfärgen samt en tonad kolumn i jämförelsetabellen.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge" approved="yes"><source>Badge text</source><target>Badgetext</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty omits the badge. Common are “Popular” or “Recommended”.</source><target>Tomt utelämnar badgen. Vanliga är ”Populär” eller ”Rekommenderad”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.badge.placeholder" approved="yes"><source>Popular</source><target>Populär</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink" approved="yes"><source>Select button target</source><target>Mål för Välj-knappen</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLink.hint" approved="yes"><source>Without a link no button is rendered — neither an empty one nor a placeholder.</source><target>Utan länk renderas ingen knapp — varken en tom eller en platshållare.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own label</source><target>Egen etikett</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.selectLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Overrides the label from the pricing table, for this plan only.</source><target>Åsidosätter etiketten från pristabellen, endast för denna plan.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote" approved="yes"><source>Note below the price</source><target>Anteckning under priset</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.priceNote.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “billed annually” or “excl. VAT”.</source><target>T.ex. ”faktureras årsvis” eller ”exkl. moms”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.prices" approved="yes"><source>Prices</source><target>Priser</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues" approved="yes"><source>Feature values</source><target>Funktionsvärden</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="plan.attributeValues.hint" approved="yes"><source>Features without a value count as not included and show a dash. Not every cell has to be filled.</source><target>Funktioner utan värde räknas som ej ingående och visas med ett streck. Alla celler behöver inte fyllas i.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.currency" approved="yes"><source>Currency</source><target>Valuta</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period" approved="yes"><source>Period</source><target>Period</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.month" approved="yes"><source>per month</source><target>per månad</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.year" approved="yes"><source>per year</source><target>per år</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.once" approved="yes"><source>one-time</source><target>engångs</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.period.custom" approved="yes"><source>custom</source><target>anpassad</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel" approved="yes"><source>Own unit</source><target>Egen enhet</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.unitLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>E.g. “per ad” or “per calendar”.</source><target>T.ex. ”per annons” eller ”per kalender”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.amount" approved="yes"><source>Amount</source><target>Belopp</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequest" approved="yes"><source>Price on request</source><target>Pris på förfrågan</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel" approved="yes"><source>Text instead of the amount</source><target>Text istället för beloppet</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="price.onRequestLabel.hint" approved="yes"><source>Empty means “Price on request”.</source><target>Tomt betyder ”Pris på förfrågan”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Titel</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Layout</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>A checklist for yes/no features, value pairs for details such as fees or quotas.</source><target>En checklista för ja/nej-funktioner, värdepar för detaljer som avgifter eller kvoter.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.list" approved="yes"><source>Checklist</source><target>Checklista</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.layout.pairs" approved="yes"><source>Value pairs</source><target>Värdepar</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard" approved="yes"><source>Show on cards</source><target>Visa på kort</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inCard.hint" approved="yes"><source>Some groups belong in the comparison table only and would overload the card.</source><target>Vissa grupper hör endast hemma i jämförelsetabellen och skulle överbelasta kortet.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Show in comparison table</source><target>Visa i jämförelsetabell</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.inMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>Unchecked, the group is left out of the comparison table.</source><target>Om alternativet inte är markerat utelämnas gruppen från jämförelsetabellen.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="group.attributes" approved="yes"><source>Features</source><target>Funktioner</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.title" approved="yes"><source>Title</source><target>Titel</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType" approved="yes"><source>Value type</source><target>Värdetyp</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.hint" approved="yes"><source>Determines how the cell looks in the comparison table.</source><target>Avgör hur cellen ser ut i jämförelsetabellen.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.check" approved="yes"><source>Check or dash</source><target>Bock eller streck</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.number" approved="yes"><source>Number</source><target>Nummer</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.text" approved="yes"><source>Text</source><target>Text</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.valueType.percent" approved="yes"><source>Percent</source><target>Procent</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit" approved="yes"><source>Unit</source><target>Enhet</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.unit.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown after the value, e.g. “GB” or “users”.</source><target>Visas efter värdet, t.ex. ”GB” eller ”användare”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote" approved="yes"><source>Footnote</source><target>Fotnot</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="attribute.footnote.hint" approved="yes"><source>Shown in small print after the title in the comparison table.</source><target>Visas i mindre stil efter titeln i jämförelsetabellen.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.attribute" approved="yes"><source>Feature</source><target>Funktion</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included" approved="yes"><source>Included</source><target>Ingår</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.included.hint" approved="yes"><source>Applies to features of the type “Check or dash”.</source><target>Gäller funktioner av typen ”Bock eller streck”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value" approved="yes"><source>Value</source><target>Värde</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="value.value.hint" approved="yes"><source>For number, text and percent. E.g. “unlimited”, “up to 48” or “2.1”.</source><target>För nummer, text och procent. T.ex. ”obegränsat”, ”upp till 48” eller ”2.1”.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.sheet" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Pristabell</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table" approved="yes"><source>Pricing table</source><target>Pristabell</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.table.hint" approved="yes"><source>The record holding plans and features. The same table can appear on several pages in different layouts.</source><target>Posten som innehåller planer och funktioner. Samma tabell kan visas på flera sidor i olika layouter.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout" approved="yes"><source>Layout</source><target>Layout</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.hint" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards for a few plans, compact rows from about five, the comparison table for many features.</source><target>Plankort för några få planer, kompakta rader från cirka fem, jämförelsetabellen för många funktioner.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.cards" approved="yes"><source>Plan cards</source><target>Plankort</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.matrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table</source><target>Jämförelsetabell</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.groups" approved="yes"><source>Cards with feature groups</source><target>Kort med funktionsgrupper</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.rows" approved="yes"><source>Compact rows</source><target>Kompakta rader</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.layout.accordion" approved="yes"><source>Cards with expandable details</source><target>Kort med expanderbara detaljer</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Also show comparison table</source><target>Visa även jämförelsetabell</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.showMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table then appears below the chosen layout.</source><target>Jämförelsetabellen visas då under den valda layouten.</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix" approved="yes"><source>Comparison table collapsed</source><target>Jämförelsetabell hopfälld</target></trans-unit>
            <trans-unit id="flexform.collapseMatrix.hint" approved="yes"><source>The comparison table only opens on click — keeps the page calm with many features.</source><target>Jämförelsetabellen öppnas endast vid klick — håller sidan lugn med många funktioner.</target></trans-unit>
